<th class="border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top"><strong>Details and Options</strong></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Material Types</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Kraft Paperboard, White SBS, Recycled Cardboard, Corrugated Cardboard, Virgin Paperboard, Coated Paperboard</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Box Styles</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Tuck-end, Two-piece, Folding Cartons, Mailer Boxes, Die-cut, Auto-bottom, Sleeve, Gable Boxes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Thickness Options</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">14pt, 16pt, 18pt, 20pt, 24pt, 28pt, Double-wall, Triple-wall options available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
