<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV, Soft-touch (velvet feel), Satin, Aqueous Coating, Varnish, Lamination (Matte or Gloss)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Printing Methods</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">CMYK, PMS (Pantone Matching System), Offset Printing, Digital Printing, Screen Printing, Foil Stamping, Embossing/Debossing</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Insert Options</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Paperboard dividers, Foam inserts, Molded pulp inserts, Plastic trays, Kraft partitions</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Starts at 100 units, with bulk discount pricing available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Turnaround Time</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Typically 5 to 8 business days after design approval; expedited options may be available</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Sustainability Features</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Use of recycled materials, biodegradable coatings, FSC-certified paperboard, recyclable and compostable options</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Customization Options</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Custom sizes, shapes, die-cut windows, embossing, debossing, spot varnish, foil stamping, and custom color matching</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border"><strong>Typical Applications</strong></td>
<td class="border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border">Skincare, cosmetics, perfumes, organic products, subscription boxes, gift packaging</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<p data-start="2562" data-end="2668">These materials are food-safe, recyclable, and durable enough for retail, gifting, or e-commerce shipping.</p>
<hr data-start="2670" data-end="2673" />
<h2 data-start="2675" data-end="2723">Related Uses Like Cardboard Boxes For Bottles</h2>
<p data-start="2725" data-end="2944">If you need box styles that support delicate or tall products, we also offer <a href="http://shopcardboardboxes.com/product/cardboard-boxes-for-bottles/"><strong data-start="2802" data-end="2833">Cardboard Boxes For Bottles. </strong></a>These boxes include divider inserts or partitions to safely hold glass containers, jars, and dropper bottles.</p>
<p data-start="2946" data-end="2956">Ideal for:</p>
<ul data-start="2958" data-end="3090">
<li data-start="2958" data-end="2988">
<p data-start="2960" data-end="2988">Skincare and cosmetic sets</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2989" data-end="3024">
<p data-start="2991" data-end="3024">Wine, juice, or wellness drinks</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3025" data-end="3066">
<p data-start="3027" data-end="3066">Essential oils and small-batch syrups</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3067" data-end="3090">
<p data-start="3069" data-end="3090">Fragrance packaging</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3092" data-end="3209">Visit the bottle packaging section to view all styles, sizes, and protective options that support fragile containers.</p>
<hr data-start="3211" data-end="3214" />
<h2 data-start="3216" data-end="3253">Key Applications Across Industries</h2>
<h3 data-start="3255" data-end="3312">Uses of Cardboard Paper Boxes With Lids and Open Tops</h3>
<p data-start="3314" data-end="3493">Boxes with lids are commonly used when product display, unboxing, or organized storage matters. Businesses also use lidless boxes for food trays, retail inserts, or mailing needs.</p>
<p data-start="3495" data-end="3523">Common applications include:</p>
<ol data-start="3525" data-end="3723">
<li data-start="3525" data-end="3561">
<p data-start="3528" data-end="3561">Apparel and fashion accessories</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3562" data-end="3593">
<p data-start="3565" data-end="3593">Baked goods and snack kits</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3594" data-end="3619">
<p data-start="3597" data-end="3619">Corporate gift boxes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3620" data-end="3656">
<p data-start="3623" data-end="3656">Hardware and electronic devices</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3657" data-end="3687">
<p data-start="3660" data-end="3687">Subscription product kits</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3688" data-end="3723">
<p data-start="3691" data-end="3723">Storage boxes for home or office</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="3725" data-end="3822">We can also produce custom inserts or folding partitions if your box needs multiple compartments.</p>
<h2 data-start="3829" data-end="3876">Discover Packaging Options for Different Items</h2>
<p data-start="3878" data-end="4220">To help simplify product selection, we’ve organized a dedicated section for categorized packaging. Our <a class="cursor-pointer" href="https://shopcardboardboxes.com/product-category/packaging-for-specific-items/" target="_new" rel="noopener" data-start="3981" data-end="4094"><strong data-start="3982" data-end="4014">Packaging For Specific Items</strong></a> collection lets you browse based on what you’re packaging—whether it&#8217;s candles, soaps, electronics, food, or beauty products.</p>
<p data-start="4222" data-end="4335">This helps you find the right box format faster, depending on item fragility, dimensions, and presentation needs.</p>
<hr data-start="4337" data-end="4340" />
<h2 data-start="4342" data-end="4390">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is a Reliable Choice</h2>
<h3 data-start="4392" data-end="4430">Support for Small and Large Orders</h3>
<p data-start="4432" data-end="4553">As packaging suppliers with nationwide reach, we support clients in every industry. Here’s what you get with every order:</p>
<ol data-start="4555" data-end="4878">
<li data-start="4555" data-end="4606">
<p data-start="4558" data-end="4606">Custom sizing with complete design flexibility</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4607" data-end="4662">
<p data-start="4610" data-end="4662">Low minimum order quantities starting at 100 units</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4663" data-end="4711">
<p data-start="4666" data-end="4711">Free design support and dieline preparation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4712" data-end="4784">
<p data-start="4715" data-end="4784">Multiple box styles including foldable, rigid, or lid-based formats</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4785" data-end="4837">
<p data-start="4788" data-end="4837">Premium coatings like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4838" data-end="4878">
<p data-start="4841" data-end="4878">Fast production and <strong data-start="4861" data-end="4878">free shipping</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="4880" data-end="4963">No hidden fees. No delays. Just reliable packaging made to support your operations.</p>
<hr data-start="4965" data-end="4968" />
<p data-start="4970" data-end="5231" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="4970" data-end="5042">Need cardboard paper boxes that match your shipping or retail needs?</strong> Get in touch today for a quick quote. We offer <strong data-start="5090" data-end="5125">cardboard paper boxes with lids</strong>, folding cartons, mailers, and two-piece box sets—all fully printable and ready to scale with your brand.</p>
